&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5147&quot; data-local-id=&quot;58abb30a59e0&quot;&gt;Strong experience building features that protect users and improve product security.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5235&quot; data-local-id=&quot;0d4dba65c526&quot;&gt;Solid understanding of application security best practices, including secure design principles and threat modeling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
