&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5354&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e794063497c0&quot;&gt;Experience working closely with a &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;CISO&lt;/span&gt;, Security team, or equivalent security stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
