Lead Solutions Architect - Generative AI (EMEA Emerging DNB) &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;REQ ID:&lt;/strong&gt; FEQ227R147&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; United Kingdom (Remote/Hybrid — London or UK-based)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recruiter:&lt;/strong&gt; Dina Hussain&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Lead Solution Architect focused on Generative AI to support our &lt;strong&gt;EMEA Emerging Digital Natives and Startups &lt;/strong&gt;business unit — one of the fastest-moving, most technically ambitious patches in EMEA. Our customers are digital-native and cloud-native companies who build on the frontier: they adopt GenAI early, scale fast, and expect their technical partners to be as sharp as their own engineers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be the go-to expert our Account Teams and customers turn to when a GenAI or LLM use case needs to move from an ambitious idea to a production-grade reality across our high-growth accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a highly technical, customer-facing individual contributor role for someone who lives at the frontier of applied GenAI. You will shape architectures, prove out the hard problems, challenge and influence customer roadmaps, and raise the GenAI capability of the entire EMEA Emerging DNB field organisation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the deep technical authority on Generative AI, LLMs, and applied machine learning for the EMEA Emerging DNB business unit, supporting the most strategic and complex customer engagements across our digital-native and born-in-the-cloud accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with our EMEA Emerging DNB Solutions Architects, Solutions Engineers, and Account teams to scope, design, and de-risk GenAI use cases — from retrieval-augmented generation and agentic systems to fine-tuning and evaluation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build hands-on proofs of concept and reference implementations that operationalise large-scale LLM and deep learning workloads on Databricks (Mosaic AI, MLflow, Model Serving, Vector Search, Unity Catalog governance), tuned to the fast iteration cycles Emerging DNB customers expect.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead fine-tuning and model-customisation engagements on open LLMs (e.g., Llama-family models), including judge-based and label-efficient evaluation approaches for domains where quality and safety are paramount.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a bridge to Product and Engineering — channel field and customer feedback into the roadmap and represent the roadmap back to the field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enable and mentor the broader EMEA Emerging DNB Field Engineering team through workshops, reference architectures, and internal enablement, multiplying GenAI expertise across our ~70-person SA/SE organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Databricks externally as a technical thought leader — conference talks (e.g., Data + AI Summit), blogs, and customer executive briefings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of the LLM landscape, including leading proprietary and open-source models and providers, with the ability to differentiate their capabilities, trade-offs, and suitability for different use cases, and to articulate a clear, informed point of view (POV) to customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in the modern GenAI stack: LLM application patterns (RAG, agents, tool use), fine-tuning and model customization, prompt and evaluation engineering, and LLM guardrails/safety.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong foundations in machine learning and deep learning, including distributed training, GPU workloads, and the full MLOps lifecycle (tracking, registry, serving, monitoring).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Python and the ML ecosystem (PyTorch/Transformers, MLflow, Spark), and comfort building production-quality reference implementations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with the Databricks platform — or the ability to ramp on it quickly — including Mosaic AI, Model Serving, Vector Search, and Unity Catalog. Cloud experience across AWS, Azure, or GCP.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and consultative skills: able to earn the trust of both hands-on engineers and senior technical executives, and to explain complex GenAI trade-offs clearly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of technical leadership and mentorship — someone who elevates the people around them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort operating at the pace of digital-native and high-growth customers, where speed, iteration, and technical credibility win the deal.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Based in the United Kingdom and able to work across EMEA time zones, with willingness to travel to customer sites within the region as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background helping digital-native customers build data and ML solutions (e.g., prior experience at a data/ML platform or consulting vendor) is a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Public technical presence: conference speaking, published talks, blogs, or open-source contributions in the ML/GenAI space.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Domain depth in a regulated or high-stakes industry (healthcare/life sciences, financial services) where model quality, evaluation, and safety are critical.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience partnering with Product and Engineering teams to influence roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why This Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work on the hardest and most exciting GenAI problems our EMEA Emerging DNB customers have — companies building the future in real time — with the platform and the people to actually solve them, not just advise. You&#39;ll shape how one of EMEA&#39;s highest-growth business units adopts Generative AI, influence the direction of the product, and build a public profile as a recognised expert in the field. This is the role for a builder and a teacher, who wants their expertise to have outsized impact.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Databricks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Databricks is the Data and AI company. More than 20,000 organizations worldwide — including adidas, AT&amp;amp;T, Bayer, Block, Mastercard, Rivian, Unilever, and 70% of the Fortune 500 — rely on the Databricks Data + AI Platform to build and scale data and AI apps, analytics and agents. Headquartered in San Francisco with 30+ offices around the globe, Databricks offers a unified platform that includes Genie, Lakebase, Agent Bricks, Lakeflow, Lakehouse, and Unity Catalog. To learn more, follow Databricks on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/databricks&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/databricks&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@Databricks&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/databricksinc/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;At Databricks, we strive to provide comprehensive benefits and perks that meet the needs of all of our employees. For specific details on the benefits offered in your region click &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/154un3e8Xav4BceOSlcYFZRGEuQI54xMxVydRwQn54eQ/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Databricks, we are committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive culture where everyone can excel. We take great care to ensure that our hiring practices are inclusive and meet equal employment opportunity standards. Individuals looking for employment at Databricks are considered without regard to age, color, disability, ethnicity, family or marital status, gender identity or expression, language, national origin, physical and mental ability, political affiliation, race, religion, sexual orientation, socio-economic status, veteran status, and other protected characteristics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If access to export-controlled technology or source code is required for performance of job duties, it is within Employer&#39;s discretion whether to apply for a U.S. government license for such positions, and Employer may decline to proceed with an applicant on this basis alone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a> Field Engineering - Other

Staff Engineer &lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;About Wolt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;At Wolt, we create technology that brings joy, simplicity and earnings to the neighborhoods of the world. In 2014 we started with delivery of restaurant food. Now we’re building the delivery of (almost) everything and you’ll find us in over 500 cities in 30 countries around the world. In 2022 we joined forces with DoorDash and together we keep on dreaming big and expanding across the globe.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Working at Wolt isn’t always easy, but it’s definitely exciting. Here you’ll learn more, build more, and ship more than in most other companies. You’ll be challenged a lot, but also have a lot of fun on the way. So, if you’re a self-starter with drive and entrepreneurial spirit, this could be the ride of your life.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Wolt’s AdTech &amp;amp; Promotions team is building the systems that power how restaurants and brands grow on our platform. From campaign creation to optimization and forecasting, we develop tools that help advertisers make smarter decisions and drive measurable results. As we expand our offering, we are investing in new capabilities that combine real-time data, scalable systems, and intuitive user experiences to unlock the next phase of growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Staff Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to join the Wolt AdTech &amp;amp; Promotions organization, who can drive technical direction across this space and help us build reliable, scalable systems that directly impact revenue and advertiser success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the technical vision and architecture for Wolt’s AdTech and Promotions platforms, ensuring they are scalable, reliable, and high-performing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide technical leadership across multiple teams and projects, bringing architectural consistency to complex, large-scale systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work across the &lt;strong&gt;end-to-end domain&lt;/strong&gt;, contributing to backend services, data pipelines, and advertiser-facing tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and evolve systems that support &lt;strong&gt;campaign execution, targeting, ranking, allocation, and reporting&lt;/strong&gt; in real-time or near real-time environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with engineering, product, and data stakeholders to align priorities, improve campaign performance, and manage trade-offs in a revenue-driven environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead large cross-team projects, guiding them from concept to rollout across multiple regions and time zones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure strong operational excellence, including observability, reliability, and incident readiness for revenue-critical systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Promote best engineering practices, mentor engineers across teams, and support their growth in scalability and system design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a bridge between technical and non-technical colleagues, ensuring clarity and alignment across functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the technical roadmaps of AdTech and Promotions platforms by collaborating with other senior engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position is based in &lt;strong&gt;London&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Our humble expectations&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Expertise&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record designing and scaling &lt;strong&gt;large distributed systems in production environments&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of system architecture, scalability, reliability, and performance optimization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with &lt;strong&gt;data-intensive and real-time or near real-time systems&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with AdTech concepts such as &lt;strong&gt;targeting, ranking, attribution, or experimentation&lt;/strong&gt; is a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to adapt quickly to new technologies and languages; while many of our services are written in Kotlin and Go, we are looking for someone language-agnostic.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to dive quickly into new domains and navigate complex system interactions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with modern cloud-native tools and data systems (e.g., Kubernetes, Kafka, MongoDB).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication &amp;amp; Influence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communicator with the ability to influence, align, and build consensus across diverse teams and stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working in a global environment across &lt;strong&gt;US and international teams&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skilled at translating complex technical decisions into clear direction for technical and non-technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience mentoring and coaching engineers, helping raise the technical bar across teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong sense of ownership combined with a collaborative mindset&lt;/strong&gt;, able to work effectively across team boundaries to deliver shared outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proactive in identifying opportunities and gaps across teams&lt;/strong&gt;, and driving alignment to solve problems holistically rather than locally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What we offer&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Wolt, this role provides a rare opportunity to work on &lt;strong&gt;challenging AdTech problems at scale&lt;/strong&gt;, where technical decisions directly impact revenue and user experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our compensation follows a &lt;strong&gt;total compensation model&lt;/strong&gt;, combining a competitive base salary with DoorDash RSUs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will play a key role in &lt;strong&gt;building and evolving the next generation of advertisement tools and platforms&lt;/strong&gt;, shaping how advertisers create, manage, and optimize campaigns across Wolt. This is not just about maintaining systems, but about &lt;strong&gt;defining and scaling new capabilities in a fast-growing domain&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Staff Engineer, you will have &lt;strong&gt;end-to-end ownership and high autonomy&lt;/strong&gt;, with the ability to influence architecture, product direction, and engineering practices across teams. Your work will have &lt;strong&gt;clear, measurable business impact&lt;/strong&gt;, directly contributing to revenue growth and advertiser success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll be part of a &lt;strong&gt;global company operating at scale&lt;/strong&gt;, collaborating with teams across Europe and the US, and solving problems that span multiple markets, use cases, and customer segments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role also offers strong opportunities for &lt;strong&gt;career growth and scope expansion&lt;/strong&gt;, whether through deep technical leadership, cross-domain influence, or progression toward more senior individual contributor roles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Alongside the technical challenge, you’ll work with talented engineers and leaders in a &lt;strong&gt;diverse and international environment&lt;/strong&gt;, shaping both our systems and engineering culture while mentoring and learning from others.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/Ncz4s_oBczc&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;We’re committed to growing and empowering a more inclusive community within our company, industry, and cities. That’s why we hire and cultivate diverse teams of people from all backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives. We believe that true innovation happens when everyone has room at the table and the tools, resources, and opportunity to excel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DoorDash, Deliveroo, and Wolt will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about our legitimate recruiting process at &lt;span class=&quot;_80om1qgj _1e0c1nu9&quot; data-testid=&quot;smart-link-draggable-inline&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;loader-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;hover-card-trigger-wrapper&quot; data-testid=&quot;hover-card-trigger-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;_1yt4x7n9 _2rko1ssi _v56415x0 _1e0c1nu9 _16d9qvcn _syaz13af _1rkwglyw _4cvx1w55 _19itia51 _bfhkhp5a _1a3b18uv _4fprglyw _5goinqa1 _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _uizt1kdv _nt751r31 _49pcglyw _1hvw1o36 _1372tlke _7ehiw5lj _1j5pglyw _1di615s3&quot; href=&quot;https://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-testid=&quot;inline-card-resolved-view&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_19itglyw _vchhusvi _r06hglyw _o5721jtm _1nmz9jpi _16d9qvcn _ca0qv77o _u5f31b66 _n3tdv77o _19bv1b66&quot; data-testid=&quot;inline-card-icon-and-title&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_19itglyw _vchhusvi _r06hglyw&quot;&gt;Recruitment Scam Awareness - DoorDash&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; .&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a> Ads Engineering  London

Director, Mobility Partnerships &lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Material Bank is the world’s largest material marketplace for the architecture and design industry. Operating in 37 countries, our platform has become the standard for design professionals around the globe. Every day, Material Bank connects thousands of designers with tens of thousands of materials from leading brands. Material Bank is the fastest and most powerful way for design professionals to search, sample, and specify materials.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;As Director, Mobility Partnerships, you will lead Material Bank’s expansion into the global mobility interiors market, building strategic partnerships with leading brands across automotive, aviation, and marine. This is not a traditional sales role—it is an opportunity to establish a new vertical by leveraging deep industry expertise, trusted relationships, and commercial acumen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be responsible for identifying, engaging, and securing founding brand partners while serving as Material Bank’s representative within a highly specialized industry. Success in this role requires credibility, confidence, and the ability to build long-term relationships with senior leaders across Europe and North America. You understand the business, speak the language of the industry, and know how to create value beyond the transaction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a senior, external-facing role for someone who has spent their career within the mobility interiors ecosystem. You thrive in face-to-face conversations, industry events, customer visits, and executive meetings, knowing that lasting partnerships are built through trust and personal relationships. The role is Europe-based and requires extensive international travel (approximately 80–90%) across Europe and North America, with significant focus on Germany, Switzerland, and the Netherlands.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build Material Bank’s founding portfolio of mobility interior brand partners across automotive, aviation, and marine.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the full business development lifecycle, from identifying opportunities and developing relationships through negotiation and partnership execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Material Bank at industry trade shows, conferences, and customer events, building awareness and establishing credibility within the mobility interiors community.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop trusted relationships with executives, commercial leaders, designers, specification teams, and decision-makers across leading manufacturers and suppliers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead consultative business conversations that demonstrate how Material Bank creates value through material discovery, digital sampling, specification tools, and market insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Product, Catalog, Marketing, and Leadership to shape Material Bank’s strategy for the mobility sector, bringing customer and market insights back into the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify market opportunities, competitive trends, and emerging technologies that influence the future of mobility interiors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a trusted industry expert, helping establish Material Bank as the leading platform for mobility material discovery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;15+ years of experience within the mobility interiors industry, ideally in automotive, aviation, marine, or a related materials manufacturing environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge of the European mobility market, with an established network of manufacturers, suppliers, OEMs, and industry leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven ability to build trusted relationships and influence senior executives through credibility, expertise, and a consultative approach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial instincts with experience developing new business and closing strategic partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An entrepreneurial mindset with the ability to build a business, create opportunities, and operate effectively with a high degree of autonomy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication skills and executive presence, with confidence engaging customers, partners, and industry leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience representing organizations at industry events and trade shows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly self-motivated, resourceful, and comfortable operating in a fast-paced, evolving environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel extensively (approximately 75%) throughout Europe and North America.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passion for innovation and the future of mobility design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job__description body&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Material Bank connects design professionals to hundreds of manufacturers&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;through facilitating brand discovery, sales rep engagement, and material sampling. Our powerful material database and proprietary robotic distribution facility allow members to order samples to be delivered free of charge overnight.Material Bank was founded by Adam Sandow in 2018 and has deeply transformed how the Architecture and Design industry works in the United States. It’s an exciting time for the company -&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Material Bank is growing rapidly and expanding the business to Europe with regional headquarters based in Paris, and offices in London and Stuttgart&lt;/strong&gt;. Candidates who join us will have the unique opportunity to define, build, and shape our European business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Material Bank uses your information to process your current application and offer you job opportunities in the future. You have the right to access, rectify, and erase this information, as well as to limit its use or object to it and give directives on its fate after your death. For more information, please consult our privacy policy:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.materialbank.eu/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;https://www.materialbank.eu/privacy-policy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;What you’ll get from us:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Our people&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;: We are a growth-driven team that values efficiency, builds smart automation, operates in small empowered teams, and moves quickly from idea to execution.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Relaxation and Celebrations&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;: Flexible PTO, Sick Days, Paid National Holidays, and even more (ask us about this when we connect).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Health Benefits&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;contribute&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;to your medical, dental, vision and short-term/long-term&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;disability plans&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;and have a strong employee assistance program.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Plan for your Retirement&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;401(k)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;eligible&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;after your first 90 day&#39;s employed!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Giving Back&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;: We sponsor multiple events throughout the year to help out our communities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Growth&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;: We’ll help you take your career to the next level. We want you to be creative and take initiative which will allow you to grow and create within the company. Most importantly, be the best at what matters!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Flexible Work Schedules&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;: With business units and employees across the globe, Material Technologies has embraced a &lt;strong&gt;hybrid  working&lt;/strong&gt; model allowing department leaders to decide on the best approach for their respective teams, whether that be remote, in person, or a little of both.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Material Bank is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. We value diversity, and all applicants will be considered for employment without attention to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, age, national origin, veteran or disability status or other status protected under any applicable federal, state or local law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a> Brand Sales  London

Social & Content Strategist - Account Director level - Corporate &lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Burson, part of WPP, is the global communications leader built to create value for clients through reputation. With highly specialized teams, industry-leading technologies and breakthrough creative, we help brands and businesses redefine reputation as a competitive advantage so they can lead today and into the future. When you work at Burson, you are part of a global community of lifelong learners who thrive at the edge of innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP (LSE/NYSE: WPP) is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. We unite cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, world-class creativity, next-generation production, transformative enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel in a single company – powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open, to help our clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth. For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;WPP.com&quot;&gt;WPP.com&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/&quot;&gt;bursonglobal.com&lt;/a&gt; and follow us on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/burson/posts/?feedView=all&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt; and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/burson.global/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;More About&amp;nbsp;The&amp;nbsp;Role&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;This role&amp;nbsp;sits within the&amp;nbsp;Corporate&amp;nbsp;Sectors&amp;nbsp;and Public&amp;nbsp;Affairs&amp;nbsp;teams&amp;nbsp;at Burson as a Social &amp;amp; Content&amp;nbsp;Strategist&amp;nbsp;(Account Director). You will&amp;nbsp;be&amp;nbsp;working&amp;nbsp;as part of a global social media team for a leading technology company,&amp;nbsp;as well as supporting&amp;nbsp;other key accounts,&amp;nbsp;creating social-first content for&amp;nbsp;Instagram, TikTok,&amp;nbsp;LinkedIn,&amp;nbsp;Facebook&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;X.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will&amp;nbsp;be responsible for&amp;nbsp;developing social&amp;nbsp;strategies that&lt;u&gt;:&lt;/u&gt;&amp;nbsp;connect audience&amp;nbsp;behaviour&amp;nbsp;with brand&amp;nbsp;objectives.&amp;nbsp;You will partner&amp;nbsp;closely&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;creative&amp;nbsp;teams, account leaders, and clients to guide the direction of&amp;nbsp;campaigns&amp;nbsp;across platforms.&amp;nbsp;Your work will influence&amp;nbsp;content planning, creative development,&amp;nbsp;community engagement, and measurement approaches.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for someone who&amp;nbsp;is passionate &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;about&amp;nbsp;social platforms,&amp;nbsp;embraces&amp;nbsp;new&amp;nbsp;content&amp;nbsp;formats&lt;u&gt; &lt;/u&gt;and with strong client management skills and the flexibility to work across different types of social platforms.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and implement robust, data-driven social media&amp;nbsp;and digital engagement&amp;nbsp;strategies by conducting in-depth&amp;nbsp;reputational&amp;nbsp;analysis, trend forecasting, and&amp;nbsp;stakeholder&amp;nbsp;/ audience&amp;nbsp;mapping, ensuring these strategies are not only clear and compelling but also directly aligned with overarching business&amp;nbsp;objectives&amp;nbsp;and measurable KPIs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead&amp;nbsp;and optimise strategic social platform planning for both large-scale, time-bound campaigns and continuous &#39;always-on&#39; engagement initiatives, meticulously defining channel-specific content ecosystems, targeting parameters, and maximising reach and impact across the relevant digital landscape.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate performance data, intelligence, and&amp;nbsp;stakeholder&amp;nbsp;sentiment into actionable strategic recommendations that directly inspire and inform innovative creative development, campaign optimisation, and future content planning.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Persuasively present complex strategic frameworks, insights, and actionable plans to both internal stakeholders and external clients, instilling confidence and securing buy-in through clear, compelling communication and a proven executive presence.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At the client level:&amp;nbsp;Leverage&amp;nbsp;our suite of tools to&amp;nbsp;anticipate&amp;nbsp;threats&amp;nbsp;and inform innovative strategic pivots&amp;nbsp;for our clients&amp;nbsp;that&amp;nbsp;build&amp;nbsp;reputation, strategic&amp;nbsp;relevance&amp;nbsp;and competitive advantage.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At the practice level:&amp;nbsp;Proactively&amp;nbsp;monitor&amp;nbsp;and interpret evolving social media trends, platform evolutions, and shifts in audience behaviour to&amp;nbsp;identify&amp;nbsp;emerging opportunities&amp;nbsp;for our clients, teams and to keep Burson ahead of the curve.&amp;nbsp;You will join a&amp;nbsp;vibrant&amp;nbsp;community of Social&amp;nbsp;&amp;amp; Content&amp;nbsp;contributors across our London office, working together to grow and innovate the offer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience that contributes to success &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embed&amp;nbsp;seamlessly into our Corporate and Public Affairs&amp;nbsp;team, working across our specialisms to understand our clients and the&amp;nbsp;factors shaping reputation across&amp;nbsp;stakeholders,&amp;nbsp;media,&amp;nbsp;policy, regulation, issues and more.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate&amp;nbsp;with creative teams, guiding the development of concepts and content designed to authentically connect with and deeply resonate&amp;nbsp;with target stakeholders,&lt;u&gt; &lt;/u&gt;ensuring messaging is&amp;nbsp;reputationally&amp;nbsp;relevant and highly engaging.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creating&amp;nbsp;effective&amp;nbsp;content briefs&amp;nbsp;for&amp;nbsp;our design team,&amp;nbsp;developing copy and making recommendations on assets&amp;nbsp;and overseeing digital editorial calendars.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively&amp;nbsp;monitor&amp;nbsp;and interpret evolving social media trends, platform evolutions, and shifts in audience behaviour to&amp;nbsp;identify&amp;nbsp;emerging opportunities,&amp;nbsp;anticipate&amp;nbsp;competitive&amp;nbsp;threats, and inform innovative strategic pivots that&amp;nbsp;maintain&amp;nbsp;brand&amp;nbsp;relevance and competitive advantage.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Articulate and persuasively present complex strategic frameworks, insights, and actionable plans to both internal stakeholders and external clients, instilling confidence and securing buy-in through clear, compelling communication and a proven executive presence.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creating content briefs to feed into our design and editing team, developing&amp;nbsp;copy&amp;nbsp;and making recommendations on assets and content structure&amp;nbsp;and overseeing the management&amp;nbsp;social calendar across multiple regions for a global LinkedIn company page&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing client communications including leading content development workstreams, updating WIPs and calendars, internal communication with colleagues&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You belong at Burson:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our vision is for Burson to be the leading ‘academy company’ for creative communications professionals and emerging leaders. We provide a dynamic environment where ambitious colleagues come to elevate their skills, expand their networks, and ultimately, produce the best solutions for today’s leading brands. Our commitment to your growth is reflected in our robust benefits and people programs, which include professional development opportunities, mentorship programs with industry leaders, a vibrant and inclusive company culture fostering collaboration and innovation and packages designed to reward and retain top talent. We invest in our people because we believe their success is our success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Burson, we’re an agency of learn-it-alls. We recognize that the things we do best, creativity and communications, require a level of nuanced understanding. That’s why it’s imperative for us to hire extraordinarily talented people of all backgrounds and identities. Without that we can’t do the essential work of inspiring bold ideas, fostering constructive dialogue, cultivating meaningful experiences, and driving innovation and creativity for our partners. Your unique point of view—your talent—is what makes you a #BursonPerson, and it’s how we deliver exceptional results for our clients, together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you click the &quot;Submit Application&quot; button below, this will send any information you add below to Burson. Before you do this, we think it&#39;s a good idea to read through our &amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/p/recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy. &lt;/a&gt;California residents should read our  &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/p/california-recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;California Recruitment Privacy Notice. &lt;/a&gt;This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a> Corporate Affairs - Burson  London

Senior Consultant (Strategy & Data/AI Transformation) &lt;h2&gt;Who is Artefact?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Artefact is a next-generation strategy and data consulting firm dedicated to transforming organisations through data and AI. We combine the rigour of top-tier strategy consulting with deep expertise in data, digital and analytics to help clients achieve tangible business impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With 2,500+ consultants, data scientists and engineers, we work with global leaders such as Samsung, L’Oréal, Orange and Sanofi. Our Swiss offices are at the heart of Artefact’s growth, advising clients on their most pressing strategic challenges — from AI strategy and governance to digital transformation roadmaps and new business model design.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Main Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Consultant in our Zurich/Lausanne office, you will work at the intersection of strategy consulting and data and AI delivery. You will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategy Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Work with client leadership teams to address high-stakes questions. How can AI reshape our business model? How should we govern and organise for data? Which strategic programmes deliver the most impact?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Structured Problem-Solving:&lt;/strong&gt; Break complex challenges down into decisions a client can act on, combining consulting rigour with a working knowledge of what current AI can and cannot actually do.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solution Design:&lt;/strong&gt; Turn a business question into a solution shape — what data it depends on, what kind of platform or product it should sit on, and what “good” looks like once it is built. You will do this alongside our data scientists and engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project Delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; Support engagements end to end, from hypothesis framing and market and competitor analysis through to data maturity assessments, client workshops, governance design and implementation roadmaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client Engagement:&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with C-level stakeholders and business unit leaders. You will build trusted relationships, communicate recommendations with clarity, and keep the work aligned to what the client is actually trying to decide.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Knowledge &amp;amp; Practice Building:&lt;/strong&gt; Contribute to the growth of Artefact&#39;s Zurich office by shaping new offerings, creating intellectual capital - frameworks, thought pieces, benchmarks - and taking part in business development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Candidate Profile&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for someone who can hold a technical position and a commercial one at the same time. The strongest candidates meet most of the following.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt; A degree in Computer Science, Engineering, Data Science, Business, Economics or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Around three to five years in consulting, or in a technical/date-focussed role with client-facing responsibility.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business Acumen &amp;amp; AI Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; A genuine dual affinity for business and technology. You are comfortable with modern data and AI concepts - generative AI and LLMs, retrieval, predictive machine learning, cloud platforms - and with what they cost and where they fail, not only with what they are called.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Depth:&lt;/strong&gt; You have built AI or data products, not only advised on them. You can explain why you chose which model you put on which part of the work, and what that choice did to both output quality and cost. You will not be writing production code in this role, but you should have the basic understanding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical &amp;amp; Problem-Solving Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong quantitative and analytical skills, and the judgement to know which number actually decides the question. You are comfortable getting to a defensible estimate with your assumptions stated out loud.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication &amp;amp; Interpersonal Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Excellent written and verbal communication. You enjoy working in teams and in front of clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Languages:&lt;/strong&gt; Fluency in German/French and English, written and spoken, is strongly preferred..&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Eligibility:&lt;/strong&gt; You must be eligible to work in Switzerland.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why Join Us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategy and the Build:&lt;/strong&gt; Artefact is neither a traditional strategy consultancy nor a pure technology player. You will move between the boardroom and the build, and be expected to be credible in both.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engineers, not hand-offs:&lt;/strong&gt; Our 2,500 people include the data scientists and engineers you will work beside on the same engagement - not a delivery organisation you hand a slide deck to.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Zurich Office Impact:&lt;/strong&gt; As part of a growing Swiss team you will have visibility and impact from the first day. You will help shape Artefact&#39;s footprint in the region and work directly with senior leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learning &amp;amp; Growth:&lt;/strong&gt; Regular training in both consulting method and AI and data capability, combined with international exposure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture of Doers:&lt;/strong&gt; Innovation, action, collaboration. We are entrepreneurial and fast-moving, committed to delivering impact while supporting each other&#39;s growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position is based in &lt;strong&gt;Zürich or Lausanne&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a> Data Consulting  Zürich

Senior AI Engineer / Technical Consultant &lt;h2 data-start=&quot;107&quot; data-end=&quot;126&quot;&gt;Who is Artefact?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;127&quot; data-end=&quot;406&quot;&gt;Artefact is a next-generation strategy and data consulting firm dedicated to transforming organizations through data and AI. We combine the rigor of top-tier strategy consulting with deep expertise in data, digital, and analytics to help clients achieve tangible business impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;408&quot; data-end=&quot;795&quot;&gt;With 1,800+ consultants, data scientists, and engineers across 23 countries, we work with global leaders such as Samsung, L’Oréal, Orange, and Sanofi. Our Romandie office (Geneva/Lausanne) is at the heart of Artefact’s growth, advising clients on their most pressing strategic challenges — from AI strategy and governance to digital transformation roadmaps and new business model design.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;797&quot; data-end=&quot;821&quot;&gt;Main Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;822&quot; data-end=&quot;1096&quot;&gt;As a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;827&quot; data-end=&quot;879&quot;&gt;Senior Technical Consultant / Senior AI Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;, you will lead the design and delivery of impactful AI and data solutions. You’ll combine hands-on engineering with client advisory, guiding multi-disciplinary teams from opportunity framing to production deployment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1098&quot; data-end=&quot;2600&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1098&quot; data-end=&quot;1326&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1100&quot; data-end=&quot;1326&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1100&quot; data-end=&quot;1141&quot;&gt;Own solution architecture &amp;amp; delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; Define end-to-end architectures (data, ML/LLM, APIs, security), make build/buy decisions, and drive projects from PoC to production with reliability, observability, and cost in mind.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1327&quot; data-end=&quot;1512&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1329&quot; data-end=&quot;1512&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1329&quot; data-end=&quot;1360&quot;&gt;Lead complex PoCs &amp;amp; pilots:&lt;/strong&gt; Scope, prototype, and validate AI/ML use cases (incl. LLMs/GenAI, RAG, fine-tuning, evaluation) and convert successful pilots into scalable products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1513&quot; data-end=&quot;1754&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1515&quot; data-end=&quot;1754&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1515&quot; data-end=&quot;1551&quot;&gt;Advanced programming &amp;amp; modeling:&lt;/strong&gt; Build, adapt, and evaluate ML/DL/LLM models using Python (PyTorch, TensorFlow, HuggingFace, LangChain/LlamaIndex), including prompt engineering, fine-tuning/LoRA, vector search, and safety/guardrails.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1755&quot; data-end=&quot;1927&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1757&quot; data-end=&quot;1927&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1757&quot; data-end=&quot;1782&quot;&gt;Cloud &amp;amp; MLOps/LLMOps:&lt;/strong&gt; Design and operate solutions on Azure, GCP, or AWS (CI/CD, containers, model serving, feature stores, vector DBs, monitoring, eval pipelines).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1928&quot; data-end=&quot;2127&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1930&quot; data-end=&quot;2127&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1930&quot; data-end=&quot;1975&quot;&gt;Client advisory &amp;amp; stakeholder management:&lt;/strong&gt; Translate business goals into technical roadmaps, present to senior stakeholders, manage risks and trade-offs, and ensure measurable business impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2128&quot; data-end=&quot;2265&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2130&quot; data-end=&quot;2265&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2130&quot; data-end=&quot;2165&quot;&gt;Quality, security &amp;amp; governance:&lt;/strong&gt; Enforce best practices on data privacy, model risk management, responsible AI, and documentation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2266&quot; data-end=&quot;2425&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2268&quot; data-end=&quot;2425&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2268&quot; data-end=&quot;2300&quot;&gt;Team leadership &amp;amp; mentoring:&lt;/strong&gt; Coach engineers/consultants, perform code and design reviews, and help shape delivery standards and reusable accelerators.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2426&quot; data-end=&quot;2600&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2428&quot; data-end=&quot;2600&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2428&quot; data-end=&quot;2463&quot;&gt;Pre-sales &amp;amp; thought leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Support proposals, estimates, and statements of work; contribute to assets, talks, and publications that advance Artefact’s AI offering.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;2602&quot; data-end=&quot;2622&quot;&gt;Candidate Profile&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2623&quot; data-end=&quot;2715&quot;&gt;Engineer first, consultant second — with a builder’s mindset and a track record of shipping.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2717&quot; data-end=&quot;3945&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2717&quot; data-end=&quot;2874&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2719&quot; data-end=&quot;2874&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2719&quot; data-end=&quot;2734&quot;&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 5–8+ years in data/ML/AI engineering or adjacent roles, including &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2801&quot; data-end=&quot;2849&quot;&gt;end-to-end delivery of production AI systems&lt;/strong&gt; (not just prototypes).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2875&quot; data-end=&quot;3010&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2877&quot; data-end=&quot;3010&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2877&quot; data-end=&quot;2893&quot;&gt;Programming:&lt;/strong&gt; Expert Python; solid software engineering (testing, packaging, CI/CD). SQL required; Java/Scala/TypeScript a plus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3011&quot; data-end=&quot;3145&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3013&quot; data-end=&quot;3145&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3013&quot; data-end=&quot;3023&quot;&gt;AI/ML:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on with ML/DL and &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3048&quot; data-end=&quot;3056&quot;&gt;LLMs&lt;/strong&gt; (prompting, fine-tuning/LoRA, embeddings/RAG, evaluation &amp;amp; observability, guardrails).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3146&quot; data-end=&quot;3266&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3148&quot; data-end=&quot;3266&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3148&quot; data-end=&quot;3158&quot;&gt;Cloud:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep experience on &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3178&quot; data-end=&quot;3194&quot;&gt;at least one&lt;/strong&gt; major cloud (Azure, GCP, or AWS) deploying secure, scalable services.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3267&quot; data-end=&quot;3504&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3269&quot; data-end=&quot;3504&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3269&quot; data-end=&quot;3286&quot;&gt;MLOps/LLMOps:&lt;/strong&gt; Containers (Docker/Kubernetes), Git, pipelines (e.g., GitHub Actions/Cloud-native), model serving (FastAPI/TorchServe/Triton), experiment tracking, model registry, vector DBs (FAISS, Pinecone, pgvector, OpenSearch).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3505&quot; data-end=&quot;3640&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3507&quot; data-end=&quot;3640&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3507&quot; data-end=&quot;3531&quot;&gt;Architecture &amp;amp; data:&lt;/strong&gt; Designing data/ML platforms, APIs, microservices; familiarity with data pipelines and streaming is valued.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3641&quot; data-end=&quot;3761&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3643&quot; data-end=&quot;3761&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3643&quot; data-end=&quot;3665&quot;&gt;Consulting skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Requirements gathering, storytelling, senior stakeholder management, and clear documentation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3762&quot; data-end=&quot;3876&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3764&quot; data-end=&quot;3876&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3764&quot; data-end=&quot;3778&quot;&gt;Languages:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3779&quot; data-end=&quot;3812&quot;&gt;Fluency in French and English&lt;/strong&gt; (written &amp;amp; spoken).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3877&quot; data-end=&quot;3945&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3879&quot; data-end=&quot;3945&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3879&quot; data-end=&quot;3900&quot;&gt;Work eligibility:&lt;/strong&gt; You must be eligible to work in Switzerland.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3947&quot; data-end=&quot;3963&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3947&quot; data-end=&quot;3963&quot;&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
