&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our proprietary, opt-in media solutions give clients access to unique advantages and&amp;nbsp;cutting-edge&amp;nbsp;capabilities. Through a single point of access to addressable media,&amp;nbsp;we&#39;ve&amp;nbsp;built on premium inventory and&amp;nbsp;leveraged&amp;nbsp;universal customer signals.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We enable cross-channel storytelling, cross-platform AI optimization, and robust business impact measurement to maximize campaign effectiveness.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
