Senior Sales Engineer - UK &lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Zscaler (NASDAQ: ZS) accelerates digital transformation so customers can be more agile, efficient, resilient, and secure. The Zscaler Zero Trust Exchange™️ platform protects thousands of customers from cyberattacks and data loss by securely connecting users, devices, and applications in any location. Distributed across 160+ public exchanges globally and thousands of private exchanges at the edge, the SASE-based Zero Trust Exchange is the world’s largest in-line cloud security platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe the future of work is Human + AI and are building an AI-native enterprise where human potential is amplified by machine intelligence to solve the world’s hardest security challenges. Driven by deep customer obsession, we are committed to the mission, outcome, and to each other. We bring these commitments to life through three core behaviors: ownership and collaboration, trust through outcomes and impact, and a challenge culture with ongoing feedback. Ready to make an impact at the company pioneering security transformation in the AI era? Join us at Zscaler.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;We are looking for a Senior Sales Engineer to join our team. This is a hybrid based in the UK role, reporting to the Senior Sales Engineering Manager in the Solutions Consulting department. You will be a key technical driver in our mission, presenting the Zscaler cloud security platform to prospective customers and translating their goals into enticing, relevant recommendations. You’ll act as a trusted advisor, guiding clients through their transformational journey while delivering technical victories.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;1&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;What you’ll do (Role Expectations)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present the Zscaler cloud security platform to prospective customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the vision and translate goals into enticing and relevant recommendations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Become the trusted advisor to our clients while aiding their transformational journey&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gather customer technical requirements and promote the value proposition in POV, presentations, and demos&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Who You Are (Success Profile)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You thrive in ambiguity. You&#39;re comfortable building the path as you walk it. You thrive in a dynamic environment, seeing ambiguity not as a hindrance, but as the raw material to build something meaningful.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You act like an owner. Your passion for the mission fuels your bias for action. You operate with integrity because you genuinely care about the outcome. True ownership involves leveraging dynamic range: the ability to navigate seamlessly between high-level strategy and hands-on execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a problem-solver. You love running towards the challenges because you are laser-focused on finding the solution, knowing that solving the hard problems delivers the biggest impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a high-trust collaborator. You are ambitious for the team, not just yourself. You embrace our challenge culture by giving and receiving ongoing feedback—knowing that candor delivered with clarity and respect is the truest form of teamwork and the fastest way to earn trust.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a learner. You have a true growth mindset and are obsessed with your own development, actively seeking feedback to become a better partner and a stronger teammate. You love what you do and you do it with purpose.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;What We’re Looking for (Minimum Qualifications)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foundational understanding of AI/ML technologies and experience leveraging, securing, or positioning AI-driven solutions to optimize outcomes within your functional domain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience as a Sales Engineer or Systems Integrator&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge of enterprise network or cloud security technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with Value Selling Methodologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience partnering with sales to deliver high-impact presentations, demos, and proof of concept engagements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;What Will Make You Stand Out (Preferred Qualifications)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience architecting or demonstrating AI-enhanced cybersecurity platforms, automated threat response tools, or machine learning-driven network analytics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cloud Platform certifications or other relevant credentials such as CISSP or CCNP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Subject matter expertise in SASE, Proxy technology, Cybersecurity, IPS, DLP, CASB, or CNAPP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot;&gt;#LI-LS2&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot;&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 3 []&quot;&gt;At Zscaler, we are committed to building a team that reflects the communities we serve and the customers we work with. We foster an inclusive environment that values all backgrounds and perspectives, emphasizing collaboration and belonging. Join us in our mission to make doing business seamless and secure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Benefits program is one of the most important ways we support our employees. Zscaler proudly offers comprehensive and inclusive benefits to meet the diverse needs of our employees and their families throughout their life stages, including:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;has-nudge&quot; data-nudge-id=&quot;5eb9419b-6a4d-4451-bfa6-e2eb96084be0&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Various health plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Time off plans for vacation and sick time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Parental leave options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Retirement options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Education reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-office perks, and more!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;has-nudge&quot; data-nudge-id=&quot;5eb9419b-6a4d-4451-bfa6-e2eb96084be0&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Learn more about Zscaler&#39;s hybrid working model and benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.zscaler.com/candidate-resource-hub&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By applying for this role, you adhere to applicable laws, regulations, and Zscaler policies, including those related to security and privacy standards and guidelines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Zscaler is committed to providing equal employment opportunities to all individuals. We strive to create a workplace where employees are treated with respect and have the chance to succeed. All qualified applicants will be considered for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex (including pregnancy or related medical conditions), age, national origin, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, genetic information, disability status, protected veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state, or local laws. &lt;em&gt;See more information by clicking on the &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12ScreenRdr.pdf&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Know Your Rights: Workplace Discrimination is Illegal &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;link.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pay Transparency&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zscaler complies with all applicable federal, state, and local pay transparency rules.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zscaler is committed to providing reasonable support (called accommodations or adjustments) in our recruiting processes for candidates who are differently abled, have long term conditions, mental health conditions or sincerely held religious beliefs, or who are neurodivergent or require pregnancy-related support.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a> EMEA Field Sales

Senior Growth Manager - EMEA &lt;h2&gt;Who Are We?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;RZR is an AI-native advertising platform built for the next era of performance marketing. We operate at the intersection of machine learning, programmatic media, and full-funnel mobile growth, powering campaigns for some of the world&#39;s most ambitious advertisers. Our platform is purpose-built to deliver outcomes at scale, not just impressions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are a team of builders, operators, and technologists who believe the advertising industry is overdue for a fundamental rethink. We move fast, operate with a high degree of ownership, and hold ourselves to an exceptionally high standard of craft.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;RZR is scaling aggressively with an active M&amp;amp;A pipeline and a platform vision that puts us on a path to becoming an industry leader. This is a rare opportunity to join a company at an inflection point and help shape what it becomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Role Overview&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Growth Manager based in London, you will own a portfolio of strategically significant accounts across the UK and Western EMEA, driving revenue retention and growth for some of the most commercially important relationships in the region. This is a senior individual contributor role. You will operate with full autonomy from day one: leading your own growth plans, managing executive-level client relationships, and executing across the full account lifecycle without co-management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work closely with cross-functional teams across Growth, Analytics, and Operations to launch and optimize campaigns, surface performance insights, and translate data into decisions that move the business. You will report to the EMEA Growth lead and collaborate with a lean, senior team that moves fast and holds itself to a high standard.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role sits at the heart of RZR&#39;s EMEA strategy. The region manages a combined book of over $110K DRR across 30+ accounts, with a strong new business pipeline, and we need a senior operator who can own a meaningful portion of that portfolio independently and grow it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Revenue Retention &amp;amp; Growth&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive net growth to meet or exceed revenue targets across your assigned portfolio&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and close upsell and cross-sell opportunities while actively managing churn risk and re-activation plays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive product adoption and expansion to increase revenue quality and account depth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively surface client needs and gaps to inform both account strategy and commercial planning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Client Ownership &amp;amp; Strategy&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead account retention and growth plans with a multi-quarter forward view and clear, measurable milestones&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong client relationships at all levels, from performance marketers to C-suite stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use QBRs and strategic sessions to drive progress, deepen engagement, and secure long-term commitment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate product capabilities and market changes in ways that are clear, compelling, and directly relevant to each client&#39;s business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide market insights and best practices that position RZR as a strategic partner, not just a vendor&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Campaign Management &amp;amp; Performance Insights&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with internal teams to launch, execute, and optimize campaigns aligned to client goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor account health and identify performance issues before they become client concerns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver actionable insights tied to business impact, not just metrics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recommend creative and strategy adjustments to counter performance fatigue and sustain growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead cross-functional coordination to meet client expectations and execute growth plans on time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain clear escalation paths to resolve issues quickly and protect the client relationship&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct client training sessions, platform walkthroughs, and onboarding as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Operational Excellence&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate forecasting, pipeline documentation, and reporting with full personal accountability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure financial alignment including timely invoicing and budget tracking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Report accurately and consistently to regional EMEA and global leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Required Skills and Experience&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3 to 5 years of experience in mobile advertising, including at least 3 years in a client-facing growth or account management role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid working knowledge of the programmatic advertising ecosystem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with the UK market; established relationships with key advertisers and agencies across the UK and Western EMEA are a significant advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to build high-touch client relationships, manage in-person engagements, and calibrate the right frequency and depth of contact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of independently managing and scaling commercial accounts, identifying and closing upsell and cross-sell opportunities without hand-holding&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable managing the full account lifecycle in a commercially dense, competitive market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel regularly and engage clients and team members in person&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to adapt quickly in a high-growth environment and lead growth initiatives with limited structural support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and presentation skills, able to engage confidently with clients from campaign managers to C-level executives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong collaborator across diverse, globally distributed teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with data analytics, machine learning, and advertising technology is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in English; an additional European language is an advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why Join RZR in London?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Step into direct ownership of a commercially significant EMEA portfolio from day one: full autonomy, full accountability, and no co-management required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with a privacy-centric, AI-driven programmatic platform as the UK market deepens and the product portfolio (User Acquisition, Retargeting, CTV) actively expands&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Earn a competitive base salary plus a structured commission plan where your performance directly determines your earnings ceiling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gain exposure to global advertisers, senior cross-functional teams, and major industry events across EMEA and beyond, with regular in-person client engagement built into the role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Join a small, senior team where your contributions are visible, your voice carries weight, and direct access to leadership accelerates your development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Our Values&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;RZR operates by eight core behaviours: Extreme Ownership · Move Fast · Drive for Excellence · Proactive Communication · Courage · Curiosity · Deliver Results · Manage Ambiguity&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a> Customer Success  London

Enterprise Account Executive - EMEA &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;⭐DataDome&amp;nbsp;delivers&amp;nbsp;real-time&amp;nbsp;bot&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;agent&amp;nbsp;trust&amp;nbsp;management,&amp;nbsp;enabling&amp;nbsp;businesses&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;trust&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;intent&amp;nbsp;behind&amp;nbsp;their&amp;nbsp;traffic—human,&amp;nbsp;bot,&amp;nbsp;or&amp;nbsp;AI&amp;nbsp;agent.&amp;nbsp;Named&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;Leader&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;The&amp;nbsp;Forrester&amp;nbsp;Wave™&amp;nbsp;for&amp;nbsp;Bot&amp;nbsp;And&amp;nbsp;Agent&amp;nbsp;Trust&amp;nbsp;Management&amp;nbsp;Q2&amp;nbsp;2026,&amp;nbsp;DataDome&amp;nbsp;is&amp;nbsp;trusted&amp;nbsp;by&amp;nbsp;enterprises&amp;nbsp;like&amp;nbsp;Etsy,&amp;nbsp;PayPal,&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;Soundcloud.&amp;nbsp;Acting&amp;nbsp;as&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;traffic&amp;nbsp;control&amp;nbsp;plane,&amp;nbsp;DataDome&#39;s&amp;nbsp;multi-layered&amp;nbsp;AI&amp;nbsp;engine&amp;nbsp;leverages&amp;nbsp;thousands&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;models&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;5&amp;nbsp;trillion&amp;nbsp;signals&amp;nbsp;daily,&amp;nbsp;analyzing&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;intent&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;every&amp;nbsp;session&amp;nbsp;so&amp;nbsp;only&amp;nbsp;trusted&amp;nbsp;traffic&amp;nbsp;reaches&amp;nbsp;your&amp;nbsp;business&amp;nbsp;—&amp;nbsp;powering&amp;nbsp;growth&amp;nbsp;across&amp;nbsp;your&amp;nbsp;sites,&amp;nbsp;apps,&amp;nbsp;APIs,&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;MCP&amp;nbsp;servers.&amp;nbsp;Backed&amp;nbsp;by&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;24/7&amp;nbsp;SOC&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;expert&amp;nbsp;threat&amp;nbsp;researchers,&amp;nbsp;DataDome&amp;nbsp;stops&amp;nbsp;20k+&amp;nbsp;attacks&amp;nbsp;every&amp;nbsp;second.&amp;nbsp;With&amp;nbsp;35+&amp;nbsp;global&amp;nbsp;PoPs,&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;80+&amp;nbsp;ready-made&amp;nbsp;integrations,&amp;nbsp;DataDome&amp;nbsp;is&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;recognized&amp;nbsp;Leader&amp;nbsp;on&amp;nbsp;G2&amp;nbsp;across&amp;nbsp;several&amp;nbsp;categories—delivering&amp;nbsp;traffic&amp;nbsp;you&amp;nbsp;can&amp;nbsp;trust.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team:&lt;/strong&gt; Reporting to the EMEA Head of Sales, you will be joining a team of 6 Account Executives, located both in New York and Paris and whose sole mission is to bring on new customers. This team has been the engine of DataDome exponential growth in the past years: be ready to join a rocket!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DataDome&lt;/strong&gt; is a full SaaS solution, with a short Sales Cycle that allows new Account Executives to secure deals within their first 3 months after joining the company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Y&lt;strong&gt;ou will be responsible for generating new MRR (Monthly Recurring Revenue) by bringing on new enterprise customers.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;👉 &lt;strong&gt;As the Account Executive, you will be more specifically in charge of things like..&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#1 Originate and grow a strong and balanced pipeline:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;From your own hunting efforts on targeted accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;From the highly qualified leads delivered by our Growth team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;From the highly qualified leads delivered by our Partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#2 Ensuring high conversion rates for your leads and opportunities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make sure the leads and prospects are qualified following DataDome step by step Customer Journey. We use MEDDPIC as a framework to qualify our opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Follow the company playbooks and guidelines, as well as established peers’ best practices and proactively find new creative solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep detailed track records of your progress and gather all relevant information in the CRM (we use Hubspot)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#3 Carrying out negotiations and closing deals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grow a deep understanding the prospects pain points, expectations and desired ROI (#MEDDPICC)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use the Free Trial as an opportunity to dig deeper and demonstrate DataDome added value&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage DataDome offering to reach mutually beneficial agreements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;👤 &lt;strong&gt;It would be great if…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a Bachelor degree or equivalent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have at least 5 years SaaS solution Sales experience in Enterprise B2B with a track record of exceeding sales quotas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a Hunter and enjoy getting your own leads&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are Fluent in French and English - any other European language is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are eager to learn, and have a great ability to adapt in a constantly evolving and fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌟 &lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bot Management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flex Life:&lt;/strong&gt; While we offer hybrid options each position specifies the level of flexibility. Our Parisian office is located next to the Opera Garnier. You will also receive a 500€ stipend to help you set up your ideal workspace.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Generous Health Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt; We have partnered with Kenko for your healthcare needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A 100€ annual allowance is provided for a leisure activity of your choice in Sports or Culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual allowance of €200 if you come to the office by bike to cover maintenance costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Professional Development&lt;/strong&gt;: #Weaimhigh is part of our DNA, therefore we have invested in an internal Learning and Development platform and offer the opportunity to request additional training and support via your manager.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Events &amp;amp; Team building: #We care and we have fun!&lt;/strong&gt; We organise ****Annual Company-Offsite, Events, Drinks, Winter Party, Lunch &amp;amp; Learns and much more are part of our Culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Parent Care:&lt;/strong&gt; Gift &amp;amp; care packages for parents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PTO:&lt;/strong&gt; Based on the country you are based from (e.g. 25 days in France).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What are the next steps?**&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Talent Acquisition Manager will contact you for a first chat&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will then meet with Pierre&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will complete &lt;em&gt;[test &amp;amp; case study]&lt;/em&gt; with the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ll meet the chief Revenue Officer based in the US&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The final step will be a one-on-one meeting with Benjamin our CEO&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Welcome to DataDome!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;DataDome is an equal opportunity employer, and proud to be committed to diversity and inclusion. We will consider all qualified applicants without regard to race, color, nationality, gender, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, religion, disability or age.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
