&lt;li&gt;Execute a disciplined sales process from beginning to end while maintaining a high level of accountability for your territory&#39;s growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are (Success Profile)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
