Forward Deployed Engineer &lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Push the boundaries of what Coveo can do, one solution at a time&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;How do you turn ambitious use cases into real, working solutions that prove their value fast? As a Forward Deployed Engineer, you bring ideas to life through hands-on prototyping, transforming complex requirements into tangible, high-impact solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll operate at the edge of what’s possible with Coveo, working directly with customers and internal teams to validate new use cases, push product boundaries, and shape what comes next, before it reaches production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role supports our DACH customers, working on European business hours. You’ll own a portfolio of accounts, working in German and English, and travelling to customer sites when the engagement calls for it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;As our Forward Deployed Engineer, you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Disambiguate customer needs to shape clear, compelling use cases and solution architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build working prototypes and technical proofs based on approved use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate business and architectural requirements into functional, testable solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Validate solution feasibility, performance, and scalability through hands-on experimentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Iterate rapidly on solutions to accelerate production readiness, generating reusable patterns and sharing insights across teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the primary technical owner for assigned DACH accounts, building trusted stakeholder relationships and driving solutions to adoption while working European hours and traveling on-site as required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver workshops, requirements sessions, technical documentation, and demos fluently in German and English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Here is what will qualify you for the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of hands-on experience in software engineering, system integration, or related fields.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional fluency in both German and English (written and spoken) for customer-facing delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical prototyping skills spanning APIs, data pipelines, and front-end/back-end systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record in ambiguous, high-impact environments, combining strong problem-solving skills with a rapid, experimentation-driven mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will make you stand out:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working directly with customers in technical, solution-oriented roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to navigate between business context and deep technical execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity and drive to explore new approaches and push product capabilities further&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience contributing insights that influence product or platform evolution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do you think you can bring this role to life? Or add your own color?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; You don’t need to check every single box; passion goes a long way and we appreciate that skillsets are transferable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Send us your application, we want to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join the Coveolife!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We encourage all qualified candidates to apply regardless of, for example, age, gender, disability, gaps in CV, national or ethnic background.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This job description was written by humans, assisted by AI. We may leverage technology in our hiring process to help us see the person behind the resume.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a> Customer Success

Software Engineer &lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;About Wolt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;At Wolt, we create technology that brings joy, simplicity and earnings to the neighborhoods of the world. In 2014 we started with delivery of restaurant food. Now we’re building the delivery of (almost) everything and you’ll find us in over 500 cities in 30 countries around the world. In 2022 we joined forces with DoorDash and together we keep on dreaming big and expanding across the globe.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Working at Wolt isn’t always easy, but it’s definitely exciting. Here you’ll learn more, build more, and ship more than in most other companies. You’ll be challenged a lot, but also have a lot of fun on the way. So, if you’re a self-starter with drive and entrepreneurial spirit, this could be the ride of your life.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we’re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Backend Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to join the Wolt AdTech &amp;amp; Promotions team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is best suited for someone who is strongly backend-oriented, thrives in ambiguity, and can take ownership of large, cross-functional initiatives from planning to delivery.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You might be a great fit if you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are a strong backend engineer, ideally with &lt;strong&gt;Golang&lt;/strong&gt; experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience building and operating scalable backend systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are comfortable working in &lt;strong&gt;high-ambiguity environments&lt;/strong&gt; and bringing structure where needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can independently lead large initiatives across team boundaries, from problem definition and planning to stakeholder alignment and on-time delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate clearly and effectively, and know how to gather, process, and act on feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can build strong working relationships with stakeholders and keep multiple parties aligned around shared goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have hands-on experience with &lt;strong&gt;AI-assisted engineering workflows&lt;/strong&gt;, including tools like &lt;strong&gt;Codex, Claude, and agent-based development approaches&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring experience with &lt;strong&gt;NoSQL databases&lt;/strong&gt; such as Cassandra, MongoDB, or similar technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Backend engineering experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong preference for &lt;strong&gt;Golang&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to take ownership of complex, cross-team projects in ambiguous environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong stakeholder management, planning, and delivery skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and alignment-building skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience with &lt;strong&gt;AI-assisted development&lt;/strong&gt;, including tools such as Codex, Claude, and agentic workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with &lt;strong&gt;NoSQL databases&lt;/strong&gt; such as Cassandra, MongoDB, or similar is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/Ncz4s_oBczc&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;We’re committed to growing and empowering a more inclusive community within our company, industry, and cities. That’s why we hire and cultivate diverse teams of people from all backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives. We believe that true innovation happens when everyone has room at the table and the tools, resources, and opportunity to excel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DoorDash, Deliveroo, and Wolt will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about our legitimate recruiting process at &lt;span class=&quot;_80om1qgj _1e0c1nu9&quot; data-testid=&quot;smart-link-draggable-inline&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;loader-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;hover-card-trigger-wrapper&quot; data-testid=&quot;hover-card-trigger-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;_1yt4x7n9 _2rko1ssi _v56415x0 _1e0c1nu9 _16d9qvcn _syaz13af _1rkwglyw _4cvx1w55 _19itia51 _bfhkhp5a _1a3b18uv _4fprglyw _5goinqa1 _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _uizt1kdv _nt751r31 _49pcglyw _1hvw1o36 _1372tlke _7ehiw5lj _1j5pglyw _1di615s3&quot; href=&quot;https://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-testid=&quot;inline-card-resolved-view&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_19itglyw _vchhusvi _r06hglyw _o5721jtm _1nmz9jpi _16d9qvcn _ca0qv77o _u5f31b66 _n3tdv77o _19bv1b66&quot; data-testid=&quot;inline-card-icon-and-title&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_19itglyw _vchhusvi _r06hglyw&quot;&gt;Recruitment Scam Awareness - DoorDash&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; .&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a> Consumer Engineering  London

Enterprise Account Executive - UK &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Endor Labs is building the Application Security platform for the software development revolution. Modern software is complex and dependency-rich, making it increasingly difficult to pinpoint the risks that truly matter. Endor Labs solves this challenge by building a call graph of your entire software estate—enabling teams to clearly identify, prioritize, and fix critical risks faster.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Trusted by companies that are one or one hundred years old, Endor Labs secures code whether it was written by humans or AI, and whether it&#39;s 40-year old C++ code or cutting edge Bazel Monorepos. Endor Labs was founded by serial entrepreneurs Varun Badhwar and Dimitri Stiliadis, and is backed by leading VC firms such as Dell Technology Capital, Lightspeed, and Sierra Ventures.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sound interesting? Let’s talk if you want to be part of the next big leap in security innovation!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How You’ll Make an Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re hiring Enterprise Account Executives to own the full sales cycle—from discovery to close—driving new business with enterprise customers who care deeply about developer productivity and application security.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a technically complex, multi-threaded sale. Our buyers are CISOs, AppSec leaders, and engineering executives, and you&#39;ll translate Endor Labs&#39; capabilities into clear business value while partnering with Solution Architects, CS, SDRs, and Marketing. You won&#39;t inherit a full pipeline—you&#39;ll build it. The AEs who thrive here create demand and run a repeatable enterprise motion with intent.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full-Cycle Ownership &amp;amp; Pipeline Generation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own complex, multi-stakeholder enterprise deals end to end, orchestrating SAs, CS, SDRs, and Marketing to win.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-source a meaningful share of your pipeline through strategic, trigger-based prospecting—you create demand, you don&#39;t wait for it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Value-Based Selling &amp;amp; MEDDPICC&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run rigorous discovery and qualify with discipline using MEDDPICC.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply a structured enterprise motion (e.g., Command of the Message) to move deals with purpose and predictability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Storytelling &amp;amp; Champion Building&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate technical depth into clear business outcomes and build a credible business case tied to measurable value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Map the buying committee, build internal champions, and earn trusted-advisor status—you sell insight, not a feature checklist.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Forecast Discipline &amp;amp; Ownership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage pipeline rigorously, forecast with precision, and consistently exceed targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrive in a fast-paced, high-growth environment—taking ownership over titles to win for the customer and the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring to the Table&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’re a strategic, technical seller who loves simplifying complexity and guiding customers through transformation. You know how to navigate ambiguity, collaborate deeply, and earn trust through insight and credibility.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of full-cycle enterprise sales experience in cybersecurity, DevOps, or developer tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong track record of closing multi-threaded, six-figure deals with enterprise accounts&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a structured, playbook-driven motion—Command of the Message, Force Management, MEDDPICC (or MEDDIC), or a comparable value-selling methodology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated over-attainment: President&#39;s Club, top-decile ranking, or a consistent record of beating quota.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve done your best work at high-growth companies where you had to &lt;em&gt;create&lt;/em&gt; demand, not fulfill inbound—and you know the difference.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort selling to technical buyers—CISOs, Heads of Security, Engineering and Developer Productivity leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High curiosity and initiative—you don&#39;t follow scripts, you lead the conversation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;The Bar We Hire To&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We hold a bar above the market, and we&#39;re transparent about what it is. The best reps at Endor aren&#39;t defined by pedigree—they&#39;re defined by how they operate. We hire people who:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead with character.&lt;/strong&gt; Commitment, humility, and grit. You&#39;ve overcome something hard, you want to be the best, and you carry a strong moral compass into every room.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are coachable by default.&lt;/strong&gt; You seek feedback, act on it fast, and treat every deal as a chance to get better.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Think sharply and translate complexity.&lt;/strong&gt; You build a credible business case and make hard concepts simple.&lt;/li&gt;
